@startuml
' Figure 12.8  Reconciliation against the settlement file
' Reading order: top to bottom. The reconciler groups the processor's
' credits by charge and compares them with the refunds owed, without
' needing the ledger.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
participant "Processor" as P <<ops>>
participant "Reconciler" as R <<evidence>>
participant "Risk" as T <<org>>
P -> R : settlement file\n5,358 credits
R -> R : refunds owed: 5,146\ngroup by charge
R -> T : 212 extra\n$61,000.00
R -> T : 0 owed, not paid
@enduml
